<title>USA: Rexene says 1.15 mln shares tendered.</title>
<headline>Rexene says 1.15 mln shares tendered.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rexene Corp said Wednesday that as of May 27 approximately 1.15 million common shares had been tendered in its Dutch auction tender offer for up to 2.156 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>It said it was extending expiration of the tender offer through June 19.  The offer was previously scheduled to expire May 29.</p>
<p>Rexene, through its Rexene Products and CT Film divisions, manufactures thermoplastic resins, styrene and plastic film.</p>
